  <div class="about-page">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>
      <em>Bedroom Dialectics</em> is where I write down things I'm trying to figure out.
    </p>

    <p>
      Most of it comes from noticing ordinary things—work, physical systems, daily habits, and how things actually operate when you look past the noise.
    </p>

    <p>
      Writing them down into plain sentences is just a way to see if an idea holds up or if it was only late-night restlessness.
    </p>

    <p>
      No fixed schedule or grand conclusions. Just an open notebook.
    </p>

    <h2>Colophon</h2>

    <p>
      Built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Astro</a>, static HTML/CSS, and set in <em>IBM Plex Mono</em>. No tracking, ads, or cookies.
    </p>

    <p>
      New essays are published via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
